WEBVTT

00:01.670 --> 00:05.670
What's going on with Kano?
She won't even answer her phone.

00:06.080 --> 00:11.000
For now, though, we should just
get on with whatever we can.

00:11.580 --> 00:15.630
True. Whatever we can, which means...

00:18.380 --> 00:19.960
Welcome...!

00:23.330 --> 00:28.250
Mahou wa itsukara tsukaeru yoni narunoka

00:28.380 --> 00:33.130
Tokubetsu na nanika ni zutto akogareteta

00:33.420 --> 00:38.290
1 2 3 de maenarae B C D iiko ni suru no wa

00:38.420 --> 00:43.880
Watashi janai tte watashi ga ichiban shitteirunda

00:44.750 --> 00:50.460
Konomama de ii nante dare mo omocchanai yo

00:50.460 --> 00:53.250
Aseru ryouashi ga omoi no

00:54.250 --> 00:57.920
Konna ni chikaku ni iru kimi ni sae

00:58.040 --> 01:02.670
Modokashii hodo todokanai noni kono me ga utsushita

01:02.920 --> 01:08.540
Irotoridori yoridori midori no mei

01:08.540 --> 01:13.540
Nando datte mou iyannatatte kimi to kyoumei

01:13.750 --> 01:18.500
Loop shisou na shikou o yabutte

01:18.500 --> 01:23.130
Yuutsu na hibi ni mayday watashi wa chuu o matte

01:23.130 --> 01:27.790
Kumorizora no fuchi ni kaburitsuki

01:27.960 --> 01:35.750
Nomikomu nigai suppai shoppai igai ni amai no kamoshirenai na

01:38.080 --> 01:44.880
Hikari no sashikomu hou e ikunda

01:52.790 --> 01:57.210
Hey, is this really the best thing
we could be doing right now?

01:53.540 --> 01:56.580
<b>Episode 10: The Idolized</b>

01:58.460 --> 02:01.380
I mean, this is Nono-tan's place to be!

02:01.380 --> 02:04.380
We have to fill in for her while
she takes the time to recharge!

02:04.960 --> 02:07.210
The time to "recharge," huh?

02:08.540 --> 02:11.330
You want JELEE to take a break? Why, though?!

02:12.130 --> 02:13.460
I kinda realized...

02:14.130 --> 02:17.790
that I was singing for something really trivial.

02:18.290 --> 02:22.290
That the reason I sing really isn't worth much.

02:23.830 --> 02:28.080
And now that I see that, I'm scared to sing.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.540
What you sing for?

02:32.540 --> 02:36.330
Sorry, until I can sort all that out,

02:37.040 --> 02:38.630
I want some time alone.

02:39.920 --> 02:41.080
That's why...

02:41.380 --> 02:43.580
we have to protect them until then.

02:43.750 --> 02:45.830
Both this place, and JELEE!

02:46.420 --> 02:47.630
I guess you're right.

02:48.670 --> 02:51.630
It looks like you have something to say.

02:51.880 --> 02:52.540
Huh?

02:52.540 --> 02:54.420
Uh, no. That's not-

02:55.380 --> 02:57.460
Don't keep your thoughts pent up inside!

02:57.710 --> 03:01.830
I'm not very smart, so I won't get it unless
you actually tell me, all right?!

03:02.170 --> 03:04.580
That's not something to brag about.

03:07.000 --> 03:09.710
Kano said she just needed a break, right?

03:10.040 --> 03:11.000
But...

03:12.880 --> 03:17.130
I'm wondering maybe...
she might not come back at all, y'know?

03:15.420 --> 03:16.380
Hot!

03:18.580 --> 03:19.670
Aw, man...

03:20.380 --> 03:22.000
I have faith in her.

03:22.580 --> 03:24.420
Nono-tan isn't weak.

03:24.960 --> 03:28.080
The one thing she never did as
an idol was abandon her fans!

03:30.460 --> 03:31.630
You're right.

03:33.040 --> 03:34.330
Excuse me!

03:34.540 --> 03:35.290
Oh. Yes?!

03:35.630 --> 03:37.830
Can I get one Frozen Angel Kiss, please?

03:39.130 --> 03:40.130
Kiss?!

03:40.130 --> 03:43.960
Umm no, my heart belongs to my one and only Nono-tan,

03:43.960 --> 03:45.380
and I mean, a kiss by definition is...

03:45.380 --> 03:46.000
Huh?

03:46.250 --> 03:47.880
Then can the other lady help me?

03:47.880 --> 03:51.710
Sorry. I specialize in dishes because
I'm no good with customers.

03:51.710 --> 03:52.580
What...?

03:52.830 --> 03:54.250
Look, both of you.

03:54.750 --> 03:56.330
Can I have a word?

03:57.130 --> 03:58.790
<b>Who is JELEE? An Analysis of Rumors</b>

03:57.130 --> 03:58.790
<b>JELEE's Identity</b>

03:57.130 --> 03:58.790
<b>She might be working at a bar in Tokyo?</b>

03:59.040 --> 04:00.580
<b>Is she actually Nonoka Tachibana?</b>

04:03.290 --> 04:05.540
Customer service is so difficult!

04:05.960 --> 04:08.170
Everyone has their strengths and weaknesses.

04:08.750 --> 04:11.130
But you can probably manage handing out tissues, right?

04:11.380 --> 04:12.920
Yes, I think so.

04:13.290 --> 04:14.670
What about you?

04:15.040 --> 04:16.670
Delivering food to a regular.

04:17.000 --> 04:20.080
Some influencer who's been gaining traction lately.

04:23.170 --> 04:24.500
Yeah, hello-

04:24.500 --> 04:25.330
Whoa?!

04:25.330 --> 04:26.960
Why didn't you tell us?!

04:28.130 --> 04:30.000
Uh? What's this about?

04:30.000 --> 04:34.000
What else? Is JELEE's Yoru Umitsuki you, Mahiru?!

04:35.000 --> 04:37.710
Ohh. So you saw.

04:36.130 --> 04:39.210
<b>JELEE's illustrator (real identity) finally uncovered?! With a look into her possible age
and relationship history!</b>

04:36.130 --> 04:39.210
<b>Yoru Umitsuki</b>

04:36.130 --> 04:39.210
<b>She might be an actual high-school-aged creative?!</b>

04:36.130 --> 04:39.210
<b>• Yoru Umitsuki's real face leaked in photos, more the cute type than you might think.
• How old is Yoru Umitsuki?
• Yoru Umitsuki's relationship with JELEE and the other members.</b>

04:38.170 --> 04:40.080
Yeah, that's me.

04:39.420 --> 04:42.960
<b>I$noFactor (a.k.a.I$)
Detected hints of a first impulse under the tracks in
Shibuya. The premonition of brilliance is hard to miss.
Street photography is my new dog tag, an identifier
to burn into memory.
Grateful for the start of something special.</b>

04:39.420 --> 04:42.960
<b>Kan@Y-tube_JELEEHig
Highlights from their last live streamed virtual gig!
Here are the best shots of each member! (2/4)</b>

04:39.430 --> 04:42.960
<b>Retweet if you think the Little JELEE shirts they wore
were cute. Hope they go on sale as merch!</b>

04:39.430 --> 04:42.960
<b>#JELEEisThisGirl</b>

04:41.420 --> 04:44.380
100k followers? You're famous!

04:44.380 --> 04:45.710
It's amazing!

04:45.710 --> 04:49.460
Since we had that conversation,
you managed to become a somebody, Mahiru!

04:50.080 --> 04:51.670
A "somebody"?

04:53.290 --> 04:55.880
What kind of somebody, though?

04:57.170 --> 04:58.290
Please take one!

04:59.960 --> 05:00.920
Please take one!

05:00.920 --> 05:01.920
Please take one!

05:02.460 --> 05:03.630
Please take one!

05:03.630 --> 05:04.670
Please take one!

05:05.080 --> 05:06.250
Please take one!

05:10.040 --> 05:11.380
Thank you so very much!

05:13.040 --> 05:13.960
Huh?

05:15.460 --> 05:17.960
Wait. That girl...

05:19.380 --> 05:24.080
That streamlined nose...
Like the legendary beauty Yang Guifei.

05:24.460 --> 05:25.380
Are you Mero?

05:30.330 --> 05:31.170
Uh...?

05:31.920 --> 05:33.290
Mero, listen I-

05:33.290 --> 05:34.210
Shh!

05:35.380 --> 05:37.330
Not so loud, okay?

05:44.000 --> 05:44.880
Here!

05:45.330 --> 05:47.630
Just don't post it on your socials, yeah?

05:47.630 --> 05:49.080
Oh, umm...

05:49.080 --> 05:51.210
Huh? You're not after a photo?

05:51.710 --> 05:54.920
Actually, I have something I want to ask you!

05:56.250 --> 05:57.170
Uh?

05:58.080 --> 06:03.290
Ooh, I'm sorry! I reserve chatting for
fans who come to the meet-and-greets.

06:03.500 --> 06:05.420
Um, but I'm not a fan!

06:05.420 --> 06:06.920
Aww, okay.

06:07.500 --> 06:09.330
I'll give you a treat.

06:13.830 --> 06:14.920
Satisfied?

06:15.420 --> 06:18.420
Y-yesh, thank you very much.

06:19.080 --> 06:20.880
Guess I melted your heart!

06:21.210 --> 06:22.790
You sure did...

06:23.670 --> 06:24.750
Bye now!

06:27.920 --> 06:31.630
Th-that's not it! Please, hold on!

06:33.380 --> 06:35.420
An "influencer," huh...?

06:35.420 --> 06:37.420
<b>Baba</b>

06:39.710 --> 06:41.250
You're here at last!

06:41.250 --> 06:42.330
Uh, what?

06:42.500 --> 06:43.880
It's Kiui!

06:43.880 --> 06:45.500
It's been a while.

06:56.630 --> 06:57.580
Hmm?

06:59.420 --> 07:00.830
I found you.

07:00.830 --> 07:02.790
<b>ARRRRRRGH!</b>

07:03.170 --> 07:06.630
Wait, please! I need to ask you something!

07:07.790 --> 07:11.080
Huh! So you're working there now!

07:11.710 --> 07:12.880
You're gonna put on weight.

07:13.170 --> 07:14.500
Not to worry!

07:14.790 --> 07:16.540
I decided to forget about appearances and

07:16.540 --> 07:20.540
now I'm active online as the extreme-eating
Y-Tuber Nom Nom Baba!

07:19.830 --> 07:22.040
<b>Thirty-Something Mom</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:22.040
<b>Idol</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:22.040
<b>1.8 kg hunks</b>

07:19.840 --> 07:22.040
<b>of steak!</b>

07:23.580 --> 07:26.750
So most anything goes on Y-Tube, huh?

07:27.460 --> 07:31.420
<b>Karaoke</b>

07:29.880 --> 07:34.460
Right, it's because I posted a story like I usually do.

07:35.080 --> 07:38.080
I haven't posted that I'm here though,
so I should be safe now.

07:38.080 --> 07:38.960
There you are!

07:38.960 --> 07:40.920
<b>ARRRRRRGH!</b>

07:41.250 --> 07:42.670
How did you know?!

07:42.670 --> 07:47.790
That's easy! At this time every week,
you live stream a vocal training sesh on your Pinsta, so-

07:48.130 --> 07:51.080
Judging from your pre-sesh activity
and background images-

07:51.080 --> 07:54.380
Master sleuth Mei Kim Anouk Takanashi can...

07:54.380 --> 07:55.080
Huh?

07:56.380 --> 07:57.830
I'd like to pay.

07:57.830 --> 07:59.380
Hold on, please!

07:59.380 --> 08:02.630
Look, singing karaoke with a fan's totally not-

08:02.630 --> 08:03.880
No, you don't understand.

08:04.210 --> 08:05.880
I'm Kimura from JELEE!

08:06.880 --> 08:07.710
Huh?

08:12.170 --> 08:13.500
Where are they?

08:13.670 --> 08:14.500
Excuse me!

08:14.500 --> 08:15.330
Excuse me.

08:15.330 --> 08:16.210
Excuse me!

08:16.210 --> 08:17.880
Oh, right! Coming!

08:18.380 --> 08:20.830
<b>Is she actually Nonoka Tachibana?</b>

08:18.580 --> 08:20.750
Ah, I see. Kano said that?

08:21.250 --> 08:24.420
If she's not emotionally ready to sing,
there's nothing we can do.

08:24.880 --> 08:27.250
What about the new song
you announce for the end of the year?

08:27.460 --> 08:29.790
The new song's probably not happening.

08:30.080 --> 08:34.210
We're planning to cancel
next week's live stream and all that, too.

08:35.880 --> 08:37.210
You should still do it.

08:38.130 --> 08:40.460
But we can't do a live stream without her...

08:40.580 --> 08:41.880
You have to do it anyway!

08:41.880 --> 08:45.170
If you're worried, you can just
invite a guest to your stream!

08:45.460 --> 08:46.380
A guest?

08:46.540 --> 08:49.420
Exactly! The unstoppable new online sensation...

08:49.790 --> 08:50.830
Me!

08:51.130 --> 08:52.210
Thanks have a great day.

08:53.750 --> 08:57.710
<b>Karaoke</b>

08:53.880 --> 08:57.000
A dream, want to dream, it's not a dream

08:57.000 --> 09:00.080
Dance, drops, drops of sound

08:59.290 --> 09:01.170
Mero singing in the flesh...

09:00.080 --> 09:04.790
Like tears, tears aren't so bad

09:01.830 --> 09:04.880
Wait, no! My heart belongs to my one and only!

09:05.750 --> 09:07.040
So she's one of those.

09:07.630 --> 09:09.250
Ahh! Time for a break!

09:09.540 --> 09:11.250
Go ahead and sing if you want!

09:11.250 --> 09:13.790
No. Singing is the one thing I won't do.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.880
Uh, nobody's asking you to.

09:16.250 --> 09:21.210
<b>Yuzu Honey
Lozenges</b>

09:17.330 --> 09:19.170
So you like singing?

09:19.170 --> 09:20.960
Nope. I loathe it.

09:21.420 --> 09:23.460
Huh? Then why...

09:23.830 --> 09:25.380
You really want to know?

09:25.710 --> 09:26.540
I do.

09:26.790 --> 09:30.290
See, I'm sustenance for Yukine-pi.

09:30.290 --> 09:31.750
S-sustenance?

09:31.750 --> 09:37.500
Yup. I sucked at makeup. My nail art was lame.
Just tacky all around.

09:37.750 --> 09:40.500
But she put me on that sparkling stage...

09:40.880 --> 09:43.170
and transformed me into Mero Setou!

09:44.000 --> 09:47.250
So that's... what you sing for.

09:47.250 --> 09:49.130
Umm! About Nono-tan.

09:49.130 --> 09:52.210
Do you know what Nono-tan was singing for?!

09:53.710 --> 09:55.960
Same as me, of course.

09:56.250 --> 09:56.920
Huh?

09:57.210 --> 09:59.670
Nonoka's sustenance for Yukine-pi, too.

10:00.500 --> 10:02.000
Watching her, it's obvious.

10:02.500 --> 10:07.380
Nonoka thinks anything that makes Yukine-pi
happy is the right thing to do in life.

10:07.920 --> 10:12.540
So Nonoka and me...
Neither of us have anything we want to do.

10:13.420 --> 10:14.330
We're weak.

10:15.710 --> 10:17.250
She's not weak!

10:17.500 --> 10:20.130
Nono-tan gave me something to love!

10:20.420 --> 10:24.210
And even after the scandal,
she got up and kept on singing!

10:24.960 --> 10:26.540
Do you really think so?

10:27.040 --> 10:33.330
She did! Because Nono-tan kept uploading videos on
her own, and got us together to aim for 100k followers!

10:34.170 --> 10:35.170
See?

10:35.630 --> 10:38.250
100k followers. Exactly.

10:38.750 --> 10:39.460
Huh?

10:39.710 --> 10:44.670
She wanted to get famous again and
reach the world with her voice...

10:45.080 --> 10:48.250
all just so Yukine-pi would notice.

10:49.210 --> 10:51.000
That she's still singing.

10:52.170 --> 10:54.040
That's... not true...

10:59.000 --> 11:01.380
Nono-tan, what...

11:03.040 --> 11:04.420
...should I do?

11:08.420 --> 11:09.460
Miss Kiui!

11:10.460 --> 11:12.210
Oh hey. You just got back?

11:12.460 --> 11:15.290
Yes. I guess we're both late getting back.

11:19.960 --> 11:20.790
I see.

11:21.540 --> 11:25.000
So Nonoka, you've found friends to be with now.

11:25.580 --> 11:26.210
<b>It's their own fault
Thanks, LookIdiot!</b>

11:25.590 --> 11:26.210
<b>#RainbowGirls</b>

11:26.330 --> 11:27.130
Right?!

11:27.130 --> 11:30.250
It's their own fault. I'm in the right.
Everyone sees that, right?

11:28.250 --> 11:28.960
<b>Take a Look at Reality, Idiot</b>

11:28.250 --> 11:28.960
<b>[Shocking News]</b>

11:28.250 --> 11:28.960
<b>Nanami from popular idol unit Three Roles
forces manager to actually grovel! With recorded proof.</b>

11:30.420 --> 11:31.880
I'm worth something...

11:32.920 --> 11:33.960
...right?

11:39.250 --> 11:41.500
Gotta be grateful for writing online.

11:42.420 --> 11:43.330
It helps.

11:45.500 --> 11:46.710
We're back.

11:46.710 --> 11:47.960
Sorry we're late.

11:47.960 --> 11:49.080
All right.

11:49.960 --> 11:50.830
You're fired.

11:51.670 --> 11:52.460
...What?

11:54.170 --> 11:56.000
Nonoka, are you sure about this?

11:56.330 --> 11:59.000
Yes. I want a fresh new start.

11:59.880 --> 12:01.830
Will you be able to patch things up with Ms. Yukine?

12:03.210 --> 12:04.500
I dunno about that.

12:05.710 --> 12:07.880
Okay Nonoka, how does it look?

12:09.460 --> 12:11.540
I'm not Nonoka anymore.

12:11.960 --> 12:12.500
Huh?

12:12.960 --> 12:14.710
It's Hayakawa... No.

12:15.500 --> 12:18.630
I'm Kano Yamanouchi.

12:19.830 --> 12:24.210
They lost to the Genji in the battle of Dan-no-ura,
which led to the clan's demise.

12:22.830 --> 12:24.210
She's the one from JELEE, right?

12:24.500 --> 12:26.670
I haven't seen her at school in ages.

12:24.500 --> 12:30.960
The line here means that even those who flourish are destined
to decline someday, which is the way of the world.

12:27.040 --> 12:30.750
So she quit being an idol but now she's kind
of a Y-Tube singer? Like, make up your mind!

12:31.210 --> 12:32.290
Totally.

12:31.210 --> 12:35.290
Those proud of their glory do not endure,
like a dream on a spring night-

12:35.290 --> 12:39.210
Sorry! My head and stomach and
muscles are all hurting at once...

12:40.750 --> 12:41.830
...so I'm gonna split.

12:41.830 --> 12:43.040
Uh, Hayakawa?

12:43.170 --> 12:44.130
So cool!

12:44.130 --> 12:45.040
Hayakawa?!

12:44.460 --> 12:45.290
Wait, what?

12:57.040 --> 12:58.170
Can you see me?

12:58.170 --> 12:59.540
Yeah, you're good.

12:59.880 --> 13:03.580
So that someday I can light someone's way

13:03.580 --> 13:14.210
I'll keep singing. Let my colors reach someone, always, always!

13:18.460 --> 13:22.500
This looks great! If we upload this
do you think JELEE might watch it, too?

13:23.290 --> 13:25.000
Pretty sure they won't.

13:26.250 --> 13:30.580
Oh hey, have you seen the photos of JELEE's
members someone posted online?

13:31.460 --> 13:34.170
Oh, that? I didn't want to look so I turned it off.

13:34.170 --> 13:36.920
Right?! I haven't seen them either!

13:36.920 --> 13:38.880
It's better that way, I swear.

13:38.880 --> 13:41.880
I mean, what we really like is JELEE's singing, you know?

13:42.500 --> 13:46.460
Yeah, JELEE's just the coolest when she's singing.

13:46.830 --> 13:49.580
I can't wait to hear the new song
they're coming out with at the end of the year!

13:51.880 --> 13:54.080
I see. Kano said that?

13:54.540 --> 13:57.000
So maybe you could talk to her and-

13:57.000 --> 13:57.750
Sorry!

13:58.080 --> 13:58.880
Huh?

13:59.130 --> 14:05.080
I chose to do this job. So whatever
I tell her right now will sound like a lie.

14:06.330 --> 14:07.380
Right...

14:08.250 --> 14:12.290
But I promise I'll improve and make good on my promise.

14:13.170 --> 14:14.330
So wait for me.

14:22.210 --> 14:23.880
You startled me!

14:24.290 --> 14:27.500
It's not good, waiting like that in front of your idol's home.

14:28.330 --> 14:30.250
I'm not in front of my idol's home.

14:31.170 --> 14:33.630
I'm in front of my friend's home.

14:35.330 --> 14:37.250
I came to check with you about something.

14:37.580 --> 14:41.750
Were you singing just so
Ms. Yukine would find you again?

14:42.540 --> 14:43.670
Was that why?

14:45.210 --> 14:49.130
Wow, Mei. You've got me all figured out, huh?

14:49.130 --> 14:53.750
But! Why would you quit over that?!
That's nothing to be ashamed of!

14:54.170 --> 14:55.830
Anyone would want the person they love to-

14:55.830 --> 14:57.580
That's not all, though.

15:00.250 --> 15:06.290
See, I thought becoming Nonoka Tachibana
would make my mom happy.

15:07.670 --> 15:09.790
Won't you sing for my sake?

15:11.130 --> 15:14.500
Otherwise, I was just a weird girl, you know?

15:15.580 --> 15:17.080
I wasn't worth anything.

15:17.790 --> 15:19.420
But then, I realized something.

15:20.540 --> 15:25.210
My mom just wanted to use my life for her own gain.

15:25.830 --> 15:28.210
Then you can change that with us!

15:28.210 --> 15:31.170
Not as Nonoka Tachibana, but as JELEE!

15:31.170 --> 15:33.040
Nope. I can't.

15:34.170 --> 15:38.330
Because you know, I hated my mom
for taking advantage of me...

15:39.170 --> 15:41.880
That's what you thought about me?

15:43.880 --> 15:48.960
...but I was trying to use Mahiru's life for my own gain.

15:51.830 --> 15:54.710
Like mother, like daughter, huh?

15:55.960 --> 15:58.170
I think the only choice is for JELEE to disband.

16:05.420 --> 16:08.830
I see... Kano said we should disband...

16:09.460 --> 16:11.880
What do you think, Miss Kiui?

16:12.460 --> 16:15.330
Well, our leader is Kano, after all.

16:16.250 --> 16:19.080
If that's what she's decided, that seems final.

16:21.130 --> 16:24.540
You're always so mature, aren't you?

16:27.580 --> 16:31.330
I mean, even if we disband,
we might always regroup, right?

16:31.330 --> 16:32.130
Let's be optimistic and-

16:32.130 --> 16:33.130
But I...!

16:33.630 --> 16:36.540
I can't think like that.

